<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="09">
<name>SRS Airbag &amp; Seat Belt</name>
<section id="1000Y_S0012" variety="S0012">
<name>SRS Airbag</name>
<ttl id="1000Y_S0012_745Q2_T00B8" variety="T00B8">
<name>SRS Airbag System</name>
<para id="RM0000042ZN006X" category="C" type-id="804LJ" name-id="RS8FT-06" from="200912">
<dtccode>B161A</dtccode>
<dtcname>Front satellite sensor bus communication stop</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000042ZN006X_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IND00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The front collision sensor circuit (front airbag sensor RH circuit and front airbag sensor LH circuit) consists of the airbag computer assembly, front airbag sensor RH and front airbag sensor LH.</ptxt>
<ptxt>The front airbag sensor RH and front airbag sensor LH detect impacts and send signals to the airbag computer assembly for airbag deployment judgment.</ptxt>
<ptxt>When a malfunction is detected in the front collision sensor circuit (front airbag sensor RH circuit and front airbag sensor LH circuit), DTC B161A is recorded in the airbag computer assembly.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Trouble Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B161A</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Open, short between terminals, short to +B or short to ground in W/H between airbag computer assembly and front airbag sensor RH</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Open, short between terminals, short to +B or short to ground in W/H between airbag computer assembly and front airbag sensor LH</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Front airbag sensor RH malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Front airbag sensor LH malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag Computer Assembly Malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Front Airbag Sensor RH</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Front Airbag Sensor LH</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Instrument panel wire</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine room main wire</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000042ZN006X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000INE00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C221608J01" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000042ZN006X_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000042ZN006X_05" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000INF00000">
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the ignition ON and wait for 60 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs and then check the DTCs again. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.10in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>DTCs B1613 and B1618 are not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>DTC B1613 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>DTC B1618 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0003" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0006" fin="true">B</right>
<right ref="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0007" fin="true">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ING00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Airbag Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the ignition ON and wait for 60 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs and then check the DTCs again. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>DTC B161A is not output</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0004" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0005" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0006">
<testtitle>Go to DTC B1613<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002T0P00JX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0007">
<testtitle>Go to DTC B1618<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002T1100IX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0004">
<testtitle>Perform Simulation Method<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY07EX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM0000042ZN006X_05_0005">
<testtitle>Replace Airbag Computer Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002RR0002X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>